# A crisp folded paper airplane, a mini friend that glides (catalog motion "fly"). Facing right:
# the wing on top, the folded keel under it. step tips the nose down a touch, quack and hop lift
# it, sit glides level and low, blink moves one fold.
name: mini-paper-plane
size: 16x16
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  W #ffffff
  M #dce4ec
  S #9fb1c4

